"role.tanukiVoiceJamminger.name" : "Voice Jamminger"
"role.tanukiVoiceJamminger.short" : "Jam"
"role.tanukiVoiceJamminger.blurb" : "Scramble their testimony."
"role.tanukiVoiceJamminger.generalBlurb" : "Scramble their testimony."
"role.tanukiVoiceJamminger.doc" : "An Impostor role.<br>Mark a nearby living player to force-mute or low-pass their voice in the next meeting.<br>Use the ability button at the upper left of the meeting to randomize everyone's voice pitch.<br>You retain the ordinary kill ability."
"role.tanukiVoiceJamminger.tips" : "・Choose forced mute or low-pass filtering for the marked player. Their manual mute preference stays unchanged.<br>・Mark a nearby living player with no wall in between. Marking again replaces the pending target.<br>・The mark affects only the next meeting. Dead or disconnected targets are not affected.<br>・Pitch scrambling includes your voice. Each speaker receives a random pitch, heard consistently by all listeners.<br>・Scrambling ends after the configured duration. Reusing it rerolls pitches and restarts the duration if uses remain.<br>・The use limit applies to the entire match and does not reset between meetings. Zero means unlimited.<br>・Effects clear at meeting end, game end or role removal. A compatible BetterCrewLink version is required."
"options.role.tanukiVoiceJamminger.detail" : "Jam a target's meeting voice and scramble everyone's pitch."
"options.role.tanukiVoiceJamminger.cooldown" : "Target jamming cooldown"
"options.role.tanukiVoiceJamminger.mode" : "Target jamming mode"
"options.role.tanukiVoiceJamminger.mute" : "Forced mute"
"options.role.tanukiVoiceJamminger.lowpass" : "Low-pass filter"
"options.role.tanukiVoiceJamminger.uses" : "Pitch scrambling uses per match"
"options.role.tanukiVoiceJamminger.seconds" : "Pitch scrambling duration"
"button.label.tanukiVoiceJamminger.mark" : "Jam voice"
"role.tanukiVoiceJamminger.pitch" : "Scramble pitch"
"role.tanukiVoiceJamminger.active" : "Scrambling"
"role.tanukiVoiceJamminger.reroll" : "Reroll pitch"
"role.tanukiVoiceJamminger.empty" : "No uses left"
